      <abstract>
       <para>Ansible Automation for &productname; codifies and standardizes complex SAP infrastructure deployment and management into an Infrastructure as Code (IaC) workflow. By installing the <literal>sles_sap_automation</literal> pattern, administrators gain access to curated Ansible collections and playbooks that accelerate system provisioning, simplify software installation, and enforce High Availability best practices with minimal manual risk.</para>
  <para><emphasis role="bold">Prerequisites</emphasis></para>
  <itemizedlist>
    <listitem>
      <para>Understanding of Ansible core concepts and CLI tools</para>
    </listitem>
    <listitem>
      <para>Familiarity with SAP system architecture and deployment requirements</para>
    </listitem>
    <listitem>
      <para>Passwordless SSH access configured between the Ansible control node and target hosts</para>
    </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
      </abstract>
